WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.776 --> 00:00:11.040
Popular wedding-parent specialists often book up even faster than bridal shops.

2
00:00:11.376 --> 00:00:20.784
That's partly because they run a small, focused system that gives each client plenty of time, so the number of clients they can take per day is very limited,

3
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:28.584
and partly because large shops handling the bride, groom, both sets of parents, and family all at once can also fill up fast.

4
00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:37.056
Generally, 2 to 3 months before the wedding is a good time to book, but during peak wedding season — spring (April, May) or fall (October,

5
00:00:37.392 --> 00:00:45.672
November) — you should inquire at least 4 to 5 months ahead to lock in the time slot you want.

6
00:00:46.008 --> 00:00:54.576
Once your date is set, inquiring right away is the surest way to secure a spot with a specialist head artist.
